msgid "Téléphone *"
msgstr "Telephone *"

#. Default form translation; client wording review remains separate.
#: includes/class-udc-piercing-form.php
msgid "QUESTIONNAIRE DE SANTÉ"
msgstr "HEALTH QUESTIONNAIRE"

#. Default form translation; client wording review remains separate.
#: includes/class-udc-piercing-form.php
msgid "Je suis actuellement en bonne santé."
msgstr "I am currently in good health."

#. Default form translation; client wording review remains separate.
#: includes/class-udc-piercing-form.php
msgid "Je suis un traitement médical ou dentaire."
msgstr "I am undergoing medical or dental treatment."

#. Default form translation; client wording review remains separate.
#: includes/class-udc-piercing-form.php
msgid "Je prends un traitement qui fluidifie le sang."
msgstr "I am taking blood-thinning medication."

#. Default form translation; client wording review remains separate.
#: includes/class-udc-piercing-form.php
msgid "Je présente des allergies connues, notamment aux métaux ou au latex."
msgstr "I have known allergies, particularly to metals or latex."

#. Default form translation; client wording review remains separate.
#: includes/class-udc-piercing-form.php
msgid "Je suis enceinte ou j’allaite."
msgstr "I am pregnant or breastfeeding."

#. Default form translation; client wording review remains separate.
#: includes/class-udc-piercing-form.php
msgid "Choisissez une réponse"
msgstr "Choose an answer"

#. Default form translation; client wording review remains separate.
#: includes/class-udc-piercing-form.php
msgid "Oui"
msgstr "Yes"

#. Default form translation; client wording review remains separate.
#: includes/class-udc-piercing-form.php
msgid "Non"
msgstr "No"

#. Default form translation; client wording review remains separate.
#: includes/class-udc-piercing-form.php
msgid "Je ne sais pas / à discuter sur place"
msgstr "I am not sure / discuss in person"

#. Default form translation; client wording review remains separate.
#: includes/class-udc-piercing-form.php
msgid "DÉTAILS DU PIERCING"
msgstr "PIERCING DETAILS"

#. Default form translation; client wording review remains separate.
#: includes/class-udc-piercing-form.php
msgid "Date de la séance *"
msgstr "Date of session *"

#. Default form translation; client wording review remains separate.
#: includes/class-udc-piercing-form.php
msgid "Heure *"
msgstr "Time *"

#. Default form translation; client wording review remains separate.
#: includes/class-udc-piercing-form.php
msgid "Catégorie de soins *"
msgstr "Aftercare category *"

#. Default form translation; client wording review remains separate.
#: includes/class-udc-piercing-form.php
msgid "Emplacement exact et côté (précisez chaque perforation) *"
msgstr "Exact location and side (specify each piercing) *"

#. Default form translation; client wording review remains separate.
#: includes/class-udc-piercing-form.php
msgid "SOINS APRÈS LE PIERCING"
msgstr "PIERCING AFTERCARE"

#. Default form translation; client wording review remains separate.
#: includes/class-udc-piercing-form.php
msgid "Consultez et téléchargez la fiche de la catégorie choisie. Pour plusieurs catégories, remplissez un formulaire par catégorie. Le professionnel précisera les soins et le suivi adaptés à votre situation."
msgstr "Read and download the sheet for your selected category. For more than one category, complete one form per category. The professional will explain the aftercare and follow-up appropriate to your situation."

#. Default form translation; client wording review remains separate.
#: includes/class-udc-piercing-form.php
msgid "INFORMATION ET CONSENTEMENT"
msgstr "INFORMATION AND CONSENT"

#. Default form translation; client wording review remains separate.
#: includes/class-udc-piercing-form.php
msgid "Je demande et j’autorise la réalisation du piercing indiqué. Je déclare avoir répondu sincèrement et je signalerai toute information à vérifier avec le professionnel avant le geste."
msgstr "I request and authorise the piercing indicated. I declare that I have answered honestly and will raise any information that needs checking with the professional before the procedure."

#. Default form translation; client wording review remains separate.
#: includes/class-udc-piercing-form.php
msgid "J’ai reçu des informations sur le geste, ses risques (infection, allergie, saignement, cicatrice, migration ou rejet ; lésions dentaires ou gingivales pour un piercing oral) et j’ai pu poser mes questions."
msgstr "I have received information about the procedure and its risks (infection, allergy, bleeding, scarring, migration or rejection; damage to teeth or gums for an oral piercing), and I have had the opportunity to ask questions."

#. Default form translation; client wording review remains separate.
#: includes/class-udc-piercing-form.php
msgid "J’ai lu les soins de la catégorie choisie et je sais comment les télécharger. Je comprends que la cicatrisation varie et qu’un suivi peut être nécessaire."
msgstr "I have read the aftercare instructions for the selected category and know how to download them. I understand that healing varies and that follow-up may be necessary."

#. Default form translation; client wording review remains separate.
#: includes/class-udc-piercing-form.php
msgid "J’ai pris connaissance du fait que ce formulaire transmet au studio mes données d’identité, de contact et mes réponses de santé pour préparer et documenter la prestation. Je peux contacter le studio pour toute question sur leur traitement."
msgstr "I have been informed that this form sends my identity and contact details and health answers to the studio to prepare for and document the service. I can contact the studio with any questions about how these data are processed."

#. Default form translation; client wording review remains separate.
#: includes/class-udc-piercing-form.php
msgid "Consulter la politique de confidentialité"
msgstr "Read the privacy policy"

#. Default form translation; client wording review remains separate.
#: includes/class-udc-piercing-form.php
msgid "Envoyer mon consentement"
msgstr "Submit my consent"

#. Default form translation; client wording review remains separate.
#: includes/class-udc-piercing-form.php
msgid "Merci, votre formulaire a été enregistré. Le professionnel vérifiera les informations avec vous avant la séance."
msgstr "Thank you, your form has been saved. The professional will check the information with you before the session."

#. Default form translation; client wording review remains separate.
#: includes/class-udc-piercing-form.php
msgid "Le formulaire n’a pas pu être enregistré. Vérifiez les champs et les réponses, puis réessayez. Si la page est ancienne, rechargez-la."
msgstr "Your form could not be saved. Check the fields and answers, then try again. If the page has been open for a long time, reload it."

#. Default form translation; client wording review remains separate.
#: includes/class-udc-piercing-form.php
msgid "Télécharger les soins"
msgstr "Download aftercare"

